Package: MIRA
Type: Package
Title: Multilevel Inference and Regression Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Davide",
        family = "Celani",
        email = "davide.celani.00@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    A framework for accessible Bayesian multilevel, longitudinal, and
    probabilistic inference. MIRA provides an explicit and inspectable
    interface for hierarchical Bayesian models, posterior estimands,
    contrasts, probabilities, and scientifically interpretable quantities.
    The framework is designed to simplify the use of Bayesian models
    without hiding their statistical structure.
